# The NVIDIA driver stack ShedOS ships, one package per line. Read by
# /usr/lib/shedos/nvidia-reap, which strips it off a box with no NVIDIA card,
# and by the installer, which strips it out of a fresh install for the same
# reason. Named in full because pacstrap installs everything as explicit, so
# -Rns never cascades.
#
# linux-firmware-nvidia is deliberately not here: nouveau loads it on legacy
# cards, so whether it goes with the stack is a decision each caller makes.
nvidia-open-dkms
nvidia-utils
nvidia-settings
nvidia-prime
libva-nvidia-driver
nvidia-container-toolkit
libnvidia-container
libxnvctrl
egl-wayland
egl-wayland2
egl-gbm
egl-x11
eglexternalplatform
